# Downwind Ambusher, second mode: "was dealt damage this turn" (CR 120.2). Bot1 Shocks Bot2's Wall of Wood on its own turn 3, and
# flashes the Ambusher in on Bot2's turn 4, when the damage is gone: no creature qualifies, so only the first mode is offered
# (taken without asking). Targeting Bot2's Wall of Wood (0/3, -1/2) it does not die, and the other Wall is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Shock
Downwind Ambusher
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Forest
Wall of Wood
Wall of Wood
Forest x16

